cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data or code, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Data and code for: A global review of functional vegetation paleoecology and the integration of plant traits with fossil pollen"
abstract: >-
  Dataset and R code accompanying a quantitative bibliometric and
  methodological review of 62 case studies (published 1996-2025) that link
  pollen data with plant functional traits or plant functional types. The
  repository contains the extracted case-study dataset (65 variables per
  study), the data-processing and analysis scripts, and the scripts that
  build Figures 1-4 of the manuscript.
